  "remarks": "PJSC Slavneft-Yanos is a Russian company active in the energy sector. PJSC Slavneft-Yanos engages in oil refining and controls a processing plant owned by PJSC Slavneft. The energy sector, especially the oil and gas sectors, provides a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, PJSC Slavneft-Yanos is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
